{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S06、S11—S13加入“年少时初恋”“多年后走进旧房子”“久别重逢”“刚刚答了声是”等较具体的联想，容易让观众把音乐意象误读成真实经历或剧情事实。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语把每段最重要的心理变化直接交给观众，话与感受交替排列，也比X左右两栏来回切换更容易顺着读下去。感受的小字层级和按音乐时点出现的安排，让细微的情绪变化有机会与实际听到的旋律对应，而不只是堆积形容词。X的叙述在部分段落因果交代更完整，整体主线也比较稳，因此连贯性判平；但综合实际观看体验，Y更容易让普通观众抓住人物的心理变化，并感受到音乐中的细腻层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b298be6-4236-429f-8cdb-8af2ed1b9065", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062334987376Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:24:41.226118+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "95dabb6f15b54a6cdcbdafb6fd0c2399906832e0d1f4b878b5e0a9f7acd5261b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f6